    "tooltip": "0 = normal, 1 = fully stealthed (faded+grey). Tweened on stealth gain/loss. Driven by AuraSet.Stealth via MaterialPropertyBlock (interfaces.md sec 5.2); the binder tweens toward a target of ~0.6-1.0, not necessarily full 1, so the minion stays readable to its owner."
}

